      "text": "Documentation Images",
      "anchor": "documentation-images"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This folder contains product documentation images used by the Nodics framework guides and renamed for stable Markdown references."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use these images only when they help a reader understand a platform concept, process flow, runtime topology, security boundary, data movement path, or deployment model."
